{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "こんにちは！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "エイに似てるねってたまに言われます\n四期生の中川智尋です( ´~`   )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "口が似てるらしいです\n結構嬉しいです🐳"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobKJtHkn.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "最近お気に入りの1枚♡"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "わこちー、ちーわこ、なかがわこ\n色々な名前で私たちのことを呼んでくださる方が多いのですが"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "“一輪車姉妹”はどうですか！？🎪\nふたりで考えてみたんだよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "うーん、やっぱり名前がいいかな？\n好きなように呼んでくださると嬉しいです！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "私たちのペアを好きと言ってくださる方が多いので、いつかふたりでシンメの楽曲があったらいいななんて夢見てます🐑"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈┈"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "ちょっぴり遅くなってしまいましたが…！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "14thオンラインミーグリ\nありがとうございました🌸"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "たくさんたくさんありがとう（ ;  ; ）\nいつも楽しみにしてるんだよ\nお顔みただけで幸せになれるよ〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5/30 🗓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob64pqGP.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mob9BZyZp.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "くまやねこに見せかけて、\n実は犬柄のパジャマでした！\nリラックスしてお話できて楽しかった〜"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またパジャマミーグリやりたいな🗣︎💬"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "5/31 🗓"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobNVm3vd.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "人生初めてこんなにおでこを出したよ"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "見られるのが恥ずかしかったので、\nセルフタイマーで写真を撮ってみました😹"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "また気が向いたら出してみます…(  ᯅ̈ )"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "15thSingleのオンラインミーグリは\n日曜日から始まります！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "お休みの日に可愛いお洋服買ってきたよ\n特別だもんね＾＾"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "楽しみにしています！"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "image", "src": "https://sakurazaka46.com/files/14/diary/s46/blog/moblog/202606/mobYNDuvk.jpg", "alt": ""}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "break"}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "またね"}], "source": "official"}